# Everything under data/ is local to one setup, so a fresh clone starts blank: the room scan and
# camera registration (data/room/, from tools/setup_room.py), the lens files (data/cameras/), the
# memory and its photos. Only the item photos (data/reference/) and data/room/README.md are committed.
data/*
!data/reference/
!data/room/
data/room/*
!data/room/README.md
*.zip
# environment and model weights
.venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pt
mobileclip*.ts
.DS_Store
range_log.csv
p.md
# API keys and the database password (MOSS_PROJECT_ID / MOSS_PROJECT_KEY, DATABASE_URL)
.env
